# -- Circle / roundabout route enforcement ----------------------------------
# The first strong turn at the roundabout is NOT allowed to become an exit.
# We first count one lap, preferably from /odom yaw integration, then enable
# exit selection.  The frame fallbacks keep the node usable if /odom is absent.
